---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | StockTheEvent"
  description="Terms of service for StockTheEvent drink calculator. Please read these terms before using our service."
>
  <section>
    <div class="container prose-page">
      <h1 class="prose-h1">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="prose-updated">Last updated: January 1, 2026</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="prose-h2">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          By accessing and using StockTheEvent, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          StockTheEvent provides drink quantity calculators and planning tools for events. Our calculations are based on industry standards and are intended as estimates only.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          Our calculators provide <strong>estimates only</strong>. Actual consumption may vary based on your specific event, guests, weather, and other factors. StockTheEvent is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied.
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-ul">
          <li>We do not guarantee the accuracy of calculations</li>
          <li>We are not responsible for over-purchasing or under-purchasing</li>
          <li>Results should be used as a starting point, not absolute guidance</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Responsible Drinking</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          StockTheEvent promotes responsible alcohol consumption. By using our service, you confirm that:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-ul">
          <li>You are of legal drinking age in your jurisdiction</li>
          <li>You will serve alcohol responsibly at your events</li>
          <li>You understand the risks associated with alcohol consumption</li>
          <li>You will comply with all local laws regarding alcohol service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          Our site contains affiliate links to Amazon and other retailers. When you click these links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. This helps support our free calculator service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          StockTheEvent shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your use of or inability to use the service, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="prose-ul">
          <li>Purchasing incorrect quantities based on our estimates</li>
          <li>Any issues arising from alcohol service at your event</li>
          <li>Reliance on any information provided through our service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          All content on StockTheEvent, including text, graphics, logos, and software, is the property of StockTheEvent and is protected by copyright laws.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law principles.
        </p>

        <h2 class="prose-h2">Contact</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">
          For questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us through our website.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-page {
    max-width: 44rem;
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .prose-h1 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .prose-h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  .prose-updated {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .prose-h2 {
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .prose-p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .prose-ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .prose-ul li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
